        "Content": "Mains Water, Septic tank\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows throughout.  Mixture of sash, PVC and wooden units\r\nLarge, floored attic space with electric lighting\r\nRefurbished in keeping with original charm and character, incorporating contemporary improvements"
